        {
          "text": "na wasya wa soo, na wasya wa ndeto; na ala meewie wasya ũsu meesũvana maikatavw’e ndeto ĩngĩ; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.12.19",
